Inter — typeface
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org)
Source:  https://rsms.me/inter, fetched through Google Fonts

Not a repository dependency. Astro's fonts API downloads the family at build
time and emits it into dist/, so a deployed site serves the font files from its
own origin. The OFL travels with those files: a deployment that keeps the
default `theme.font.sans` is redistributing Inter and must keep the licence
available. The OFL also reserves the font's name — a modified version may not
be distributed under the name "Inter".

Set `theme.font.sans` in src/docs.config.ts to a system font stack to opt out
entirely; nothing else in the build depends on it.

